OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'Time and money wasted' as police sent 
OL,5,Cto court without testifying            
OL,6,GLarge numbers of witnesses required to 
OL,7,Gattend court are not called to give    
OL,8,Gevidence - including police officers   
OL,9,Gwho have been pulled from front-line   
OL,10,Gduty, a report has found.              
OL,12,FCriminal Justice Inspection Northern   
OL,13,FIreland (CJI) said the reasons         
OL,14,Fincluded last-minute guilty pleas by   
OL,15,Fdefendants.                            
OL,17,FIt said evidence "pointed to           
OL,18,Fsubstantial levels of wasted time and  
OL,19,Fcosts to the public purse".            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
