OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'Someone will be killed or seriously   
OL,5,Cinjured' - mum's warning after car     
OL,6,Cramming                                
OL,7,GA woman whose husband, teenage son and 
OL,8,Ga friend were in a car struck by a     
OL,9,Gvehicle moments after it repeatedly    
OL,10,Grammed a police car in Londonderry has 
OL,11,Gsaid they were lucky to escape unhurt. 
OL,13,FLaura Moore said her husband, Don and  
OL,14,F17-year-old son Shea had gone to drop  
OL,15,Fa friend home when their car was       
OL,16,Fstruck on Saturday night at Skeoge     
OL,17,FLink.                                  
OL,19,FIt was one of three vehicles struck by 
OL,20,Fa red Mercedes during the incident.    
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
