OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMagill returns to NI squad for Greece  
OL,5,Cfriendlies                             
OL,6,GNorthern Ireland manager Michael       
OL,7,GMcArdle has made five changes to his   
OL,8,Gsquad for the upcoming friendlies      
OL,9,Gagainst Greece, with the return of     
OL,10,Gexperienced striker Simone Magill      
OL,11,Gamong the notable returnees.           
OL,13,FMagill, who gave birth to her daughter 
OL,14,FSkye over the summer, returned to      
OL,15,Ftraining with the Northern Ireland     
OL,16,Fsquad last month but did not play in   
OL,17,Feither leg of the World Cup play-off   
OL,18,Fdefeat by Portugal.                    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
