OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CDriver pleads guilty to causing deaths 
OL,5,Cof married couple and friend           
OL,6,GA 21-year-old man has pleaded guilty   
OL,7,Gto causing the deaths of three people  
OL,8,Gin a multi-vehicle crash near          
OL,9,GMarkethill, County Armagh in November  
OL,10,G2023.                                  
OL,12,FJosh McGleenan of Ashveagh in Benburb  
OL,13,Fhad been due to go on trial at Newry   
OL,14,FCrown Court on Tuesday for causing the 
OL,15,Fdeaths of Ciera Grimley and her        
OL,16,Fhusband Patrick and their friend Ciara 
OL,17,FMcElvanna.                             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
